                        <field name="dc_subject">Capuchinos-1711 </field>
                        <field name="dc_title">The king [Printed text]: Because in treze of February of one thousand seven hundred and two, I was served to issue one my Real Cedula, of confirmation of another of the King my Uncle, whose tenor is the following... that adjusting in each place where huviesse Convent of the Religion of San Francisco de la Observancia, and the narrowest of the Descalzos of the same Religion... the amounts that huviessen needs for consumption, and for the Divine Cult, they are deposed. </field>
